      "subject": "fix(executive): the Chief Agent's thinking form has no background and appears instantly (EW-1h)",
      "body": "The morph video's black background was meant to blend away with mix-blend-screen, but the avatar's glow filter isolates blending, so the black showed as a dark square. Each frame is now drawn to a canvas with black keyed to transparent, so the form shows on any background and the glow follows its shape. The form also started late: a new video loaded and decoded only when a reply began, while the three dots are instant CSS. One shared video now loads when the Executive Office opens and plays only while a thinking avatar is shown. Presentation certified after owner visual approval.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
